  "system": {
    "description": "<p>Harold's Whirlwind: Propels self or target in any direction (vertically or horizontally).</p><hr><p>Will Test (bonus {{math spellPower \"*\" 4}}) vs. Target's Dexterity Test.</p><hr><p>On caster's success: Propels target up to {{math spellPower \"*\" 5}} hexes.</p><p>On failure: Moves the target 3 hexes in any direction. Target takes 1d8 damage per hex it couldn't move.</p><p>Fall damage follows Falling/Acrobatics rules.</p><p>Maximum damage capped at 100. Ignores Armor. Can only be cast as Reaction on self when attacked.</p>",
